id: shrinking-battlefield
name: Shrinking Battlefield
advancement: true
prerequisite: Variable Battlefield Advancement
tpCost: 4
# "If you pay the Ki Points to maintain your Bound Squares, you may spend an additional 2(bT) Ki Points to reduce the
# AoE of the Bound Squares by 1 Magnitude." A button on the start-of-turn card; moving whoever is inside is the table's.
shrinks: true
shrinkKiPerBaseTier: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  At the start of your turn, 2(bT) KP more makes the Bound Squares 1 Magnitude smaller.
text: >
  Shrinking Battlefield: You can pull your trapped foes ever closer to their inevitable demise.
  –Prerequisites: Variable Battlefield Advancement
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: At the start of your turn, if you pay the Ki Points to maintain your Bound Squares, you may spend an
  additional 2(bT) Ki Points to reduce the AoE of the Bound Squares by 1 Magnitude. Any Characters who are occupying
  those Squares are moved 1 Square of their choice so that they remain on a Bound Square. This movement cannot be
  reduced or negated by any means.
